    {
      "id": 22903,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "## Summary\nAn attacker can redirect a user to any external website using the vulnerable parameter in `https://account.mackeeper.com/auth/fb` use parameter `continue`.\n\n## Steps To Reproduce\n1. Visit the following url: `https://account.mackeeper.com/auth/fb?continue=https://google.com`\n2. Login\n3. This will redirect you to https://google.com",
